I have completed exploring the codebase. Here is a summary of the **terraform-provider-filesync** project:

## Project Overview

This is a Terraform/OpenTofu provider written in Go that enables declarative file synchronization via SSH/SFTP with proper state tracking. It solves the "state problem" that exists with traditional `null_resource` provisioner approaches.

## Key Components

### Provider Structure
- **`main.go`** - Entry point, registers the provider with Terraform
- **`internal/provider/provider.go`** - Provider definition, registers `filesync_file` and `filesync_directory` resources

### Resources

1. **`filesync_file`** (`internal/provider/file_resource.go`)
   - Syncs a single file to a remote host
   - Tracks SHA256 hash in state for drift detection
   - Supports bastion/jump hosts
   - CRUD operations: Create uploads, Read checks remote, Update detects drift before overwrite, Delete removes file

2. **`filesync_directory`** (`internal/provider/directory_resource.go`)
   - Syncs entire directory to remote host
   - Maintains a file manifest (map of relative paths to hashes)
   - Handles file additions/deletions between local and remote

### Supporting Code
- **`internal/provider/ssh_config.go`** - Builds `gosftp.Config` from Terraform attributes for both resource types
- **`internal/diff/diff.go`** - Utility for generating unified diff output (currently simple, shows hash differences)

### External Dependency
- **`github.com/darshan-rambhia/gosftp`** - Extracted SSH/SFTP library with connection pooling, retry logic, and bastion support

### Testing
- **`tests/acceptance/acceptance_test.go`** - Acceptance tests using testcontainers with an OpenSSH container

### Critical Files for Implementation
- `/Users/rambhiad/Code/Repositories/personal-projects/terraform-provider-filesync/internal/provider/file_resource.go` - Core file sync logic with drift detection
- `/Users/rambhiad/Code/Repositories/personal-projects/terraform-provider-filesync/internal/provider/directory_resource.go` - Directory sync with file manifest
- `/Users/rambhiad/Code/Repositories/personal-projects/terraform-provider-filesync/internal/provider/ssh_config.go` - SSH configuration builder
- `/Users/rambhiad/Code/Repositories/personal-projects/terraform-provider-filesync/internal/provider/provider.go` - Provider registration
- `/Users/rambhiad/Code/Repositories/personal-projects/terraform-provider-filesync/tests/acceptance/acceptance_test.go` - Test patterns
